{"v":4,"catch":"拍攝寶島！ 不要放棄！","desc":"\"SWIMMER \"是1982年TEHKAN（KOEI TECMO GAMES）發行的一款動作遊戲。\n控制游泳者，看看你是否能到達寶島。\n使用強力藥丸，潛入水下，巧妙地避開障礙物和敵方怪物。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-03-25","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0cdf14ce27e57f96e47412911633c0571ab96d73afb8fd9fb3d9ef57dd073a54.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a21389d0c4272d708bafe750c051c05ba44855a7c226423edf58f78dca8e6485.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dcdf2f0c0d9448353a5561e9598bd91de89c32de84e02effcffa47bb065561a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da1fac913b8f8c6c57c5bdd0ccf557416019653ec29bb186db5f47a5478314d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e2665f814c627eae6d4ba535ed99ebdd623b1161970d3ea13641ccca9b9f8a6d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee12703066615ce5d195e03629893ae72c7033f4538ae418223f05ec13832016.jpg"],"titleId":"01001620143bc000","dlc":[]}